id: E11425
trigger_tool: configure
phase: configuration
error_signature: is not GNU grep|PROG_GNU_GREP|negative version banner
severity: 2
category: detection, portability, autotools, testing
match_keywords: negative version banner, is not GNU grep, optional provider, substring identity probe, duplicate benchmark comparator
title: 版本 banner 的否定品牌语句会命中宽松子串探测并误注册可选工具角色
root_cause: 对完整版本输出只搜索品牌子串，无法区分品牌声明与否定声明；Toybox 的 is not GNU grep 被误当作 GNU grep，导致同一系统实现承担两个比较器角色。 Autoconf creates config.status scratch directories in two branches with owner-only masks. On HMDFS, changing file modes later or repairing PR transport cannot establish creation-time access. Replace both creation branches with exclusive mkdir under the recipe-private TMPDIR, use umask 022 at creation, restore configure timestamps, and prefix TMPDIR after Conan environment activation. Preserve cleanup and every original test.
affected_scope: 构建或测试框架用版本文本给可选工具分类的场景；不适用于必须依赖 GNU 特性却找不到 GNU 实现时把必需角色直接禁用。
verification_cmd: 检查真实 --version 首行、配置角色和完整测试执行记录；分别验证真实 GNU banner、Toybox 否定 banner、空输出与未知输出，后者不得注册 GNU 角色。
rec_priority: 1
rec_approach: positive-provider-identity-at-role-boundary
rec_description: 在手写配置模板的可选角色边界匹配肯定身份格式，再让配置系统生成运行文件；保留必需系统角色、原测试分母、原输入和原迭代次数。 Autoconf creates config.status scratch directories in two branches with owner-only masks. On HMDFS, changing file modes later or repairing PR transport cannot establish creation-time access. Replace both creation branches with exclusive mkdir under the recipe-private TMPDIR, use umask 022 at creation, restore configure timestamps, and prefix TMPDIR after Conan environment activation. Preserve cleanup and every original test.
rec_command: 将品牌子串检查改为肯定 banner 结构检查，例如 GNU grep 首行包含 (GNU grep)；验证正反例后完整重跑实际框架，检查角色对应的工具能力，不能以 banner 代替能力测试。
rec_auto_fix: false
rec_impl: handwritten-template-positive-version-role-guard
forbid_1_pattern: accept brand substring|clear mandatory grep|truncate benchmark corpus|edit generated atlocal
forbid_1_reason: 子串仍可能命中否定声明；删除必需角色、缩小语料或只改生成物不能解决源头角色分类并保持可复现性。
forbid_1_consequence: 工具能力误判、重复低效基准、覆盖缩水或重新配置后修复丢失。
doc_file: knowledge/drafts/E11425-draft-2501.md
last_updated: 2026-10-14
source_event: ucg 0.3.3 Toybox 0.8.12 negative GNU grep banner; native r14 full upstream 63 expected outcomes and consumers 5/5; W3 log SHA256 97b5b8efa505489bdd0a80e3d2535809aed1a9ddebb4b8015ae955751d761e77 2026-10-14 current CI repair; ucg-ci-repair-w3-20261013-r103, official CI log SHA256 8808e1df9896a4d70d37ba1318d946f7e9adc8f1dccdca0c1fc4503fb6923c61; Current worker logs provide the independent second-failure boundary after the earlier checkout/fixture repair: successful source retrieval and dependency installation are not proof that configure generated usable config files. Use both-branch source reconciliation, timestamp-preserving production-helper tests and complete native recipe/tests; do not treat a missing-curl predownload warning as the cause when source() already succeeded. This extends the existing evidence/transport topic with a causal validation boundary, not a new generic umask claim.
authors: 2501_91199785 (诶，云朵)
